{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105801","id":2483466528,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UBrEg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105801","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105801.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105801.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105801","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105801/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105801/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105801/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2bacfc8b599fea4bcdd2e99d25d21037ffd3b685","number":105801,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Update `get_stack()`, `print_stack()`, and `print_debug()`","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Initially I [suggested](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91006#pullrequestreview-2791750125) deprecating these functions, but now I think it makes sense to have shorthands for simple scenarios. We just need to add a reference to `Engine.capture_script_backtraces()` for advanced scenarios.\r\n\r\n* Remove the restriction on using these functions only in the main thread. This already works for `Engine.capture_script_backtraces()`, since the stack information is stored in `thread_local` variables.\r\n* Update documentation. These functions and `Engine.capture_script_backtraces()` use the same mechanism, so the same rules apply to them.\r\n* Add stack output to `Utils.check()`, see the [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96229#issuecomment-2316077908).\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorScript\r\n\r\nfunc _run() -> void:\r\n    var thread := Thread.new()\r\n    thread.start(_thread_function)\r\n    test()\r\n    thread.wait_to_finish()\r\n\r\nfunc _thread_function() -> void:\r\n    test()\r\n\r\nfunc test() -> void:\r\n    #print_stack()\r\n    #print(Engine.capture_script_backtraces())\r\n    for i in 10:\r\n        prints(i, get_stack().slice(1))\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22"